OL,3,ATurner Prize winner's new vision for
OL,4,Ahometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Turner Prize-winning artist has
OL,7,Frevealed plans to transform a former
OL,8,Fcar showroom near where he grew up,
OL,9,Finto a centre for art and learning.
OL,11,FKeith Tyson has bought the former
OL,12,FMercedes-Benz garage on Princes Street
OL,13,Fin Ulverston, where he said he hopes to
OL,14,Fcreate a space for exhibitions,
OL,15,Feducation and community engagement.
OL,17,FThe privately funded project aims to
OL,18,Fgive young people opportunities to
OL,19,Fexperience art after Tyson's own
OL,20,Fartistic education was shaped by local
OL,21,Flibraries growing up.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
