OL,3,ATurner Prize winner's new vision for
OL,4,Ahometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said "there were no galleries for
OL,7,Fmiles around" so he thought this could
OL,8,Fbe a chance to "give young people in
OL,9,Fthe community an opportunity to see and
OL,10,Flearn about art" in a way that he never
OL,11,Fhad.
